<Page title="About CarSpecFix" description="Who runs CarSpecFix, how we collect car specs and how we keep every number cited." path="/about/" crumbs={[{ name: 'Home', url: '/' }, { name: 'About', url: '/about/' }]} h1={`About CarSpecFix`}>

<p>CarSpecFix is a small, independent reference for U.S. car owners. We publish specs (oil, tires, MPG, recalls) and plain-English explanations of common symptoms and trouble codes.</p>
<p>Our rule: no number without a source. Values come from owner's manuals, NHTSA and fueleconomy.gov. If we can't cite a value, we say "Not yet verified" instead of guessing. Every page is checked by a person before it goes live.</p>
<p>We are data compilers, not certified mechanics. See <a href="/sources/">data sources</a> and <a href="/authors/editor/">our editor</a>.</p>
</Page>
